						               													<description>Flick 'em Up!: Dead of Winter pits players against zombies in a dexterity game that has you using tools in various ways to take out the undead while they in turn shamble somewhat randomly in your direction.

Based on the best-selling Dead of Winter, form your group of ten survivors and explore the city with ten scenarios. Shh! The slightest sound will wake the zombies! With the new &amp;mdash; and terrifying &amp;mdash; zombie tower, you'd better be ready and rearing to go when the zombies attack! Will you be able to flick some zombies?

Part of the Dead of Winter series.

</description>
